{
  "key": 8462,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00000",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What’s going on...?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00001",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00002",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor, there isn’t anything out\n",
        "of the ordinary on the other side,\\feither!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor, there’s nothing out of the\n",
        "ordinary on the other side, either!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Hmm...\n",
        "I may have been mistaken...\r",
        "Something appears to be different\n",
        "than it was before, but...\r",
        "Fine! It’s enough that we have\n",
        "seen the lake.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00006",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, we’re leaving.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Professor, how are you enjoying\n",
        "being back in Sinnoh?\r",
        "After being away for four years,\n",
        "it must be exciting again?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Professor, you’ve been gone\n",
        "for four years now.\r",
        "How are you enjoying being back in\n",
        "Sinnoh?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: ...Hm.\n",
        "There is one thing I can say.\r",
        "There are many rare kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "in Sinnoh.\r",
        "The region should serve us very well\n",
        "in regard to our studies.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Excuse me.\n",
        "Let us pass, please.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I beg your pardon...\n",
        "We’ll be on our way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00012",
      "en_US": "Lucas: Sorry, folks.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?\n",
        "Those two...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Let’s go check this out!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "What’s that?\n",
        "Don’t go into the tall grass?\r",
        "No problem, no problem!\r",
        "We won’t be in there long enough\n",
        "for a wild Pokémon to come out.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s...\n",
        "A briefcase?\r",
        "Those people forgot it here.\n",
        "What are we supposed to do with it?\r",
        "We can try to deliver it, but who are\n",
        "they? I heard them say professor...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Waaah!\n",
        "Po-Pokémon?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00018",
      "en_US": "What’s going on?!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Fwaaah!\n",
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} totally rocked!\r",
        "But my {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} was way tougher\n",
        "than yours!\r",
        "...They were other people’s\n",
        "Pokémon, though...\r",
        "But we had to use them...\n",
        "They won’t mind, will they?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh! There’s the briefcase!\r",
        "The professor would have been furious\n",
        "if I’d lost it...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Huh?\n",
        "Oh, no!\r",
        "Did you...\n",
        "Did you use the Pokémon in here?\r",
        "You did?! Oh, my gosh!\n",
        "What’s the professor going to say...?\r",
        "...This is so not good...\n",
        "I’ll take this briefcase for now.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Whew! You found the briefcase?\r",
        "The professor would’ve gone through\n",
        "the roof if he knew I forgot it here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hunh?\n",
        "Whaaaat?!\r",
        "Did you guys...\n",
        "Did you use these Pokémon?!\r",
        "Oh, man... How am I gonna explain\n",
        "this to the professor?\r",
        "...This briefcase is the professor’s,\n",
        "so I’ll take it, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00024",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "I don’t know what’s going on.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let’s get out of here.\r",
        "My Pokémon got hurt from that\n",
        "battle.\r",
        "If we get attacked by another\n",
        "Pokémon, we might be in trouble.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hmmm...\r",
        "No legendary Pokémon, nothing out\n",
        "of the ordinary...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake Valor?\n",
        "Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You’re just going there now?\n",
        "You’ve got to move faster than that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake\n",
        "Valor? Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You’re just going there now?\n",
        "You’ve got to move faster than that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was\n",
        "Lake Valor?\r",
        "There’s nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake hasn’t changed at all.\r",
        "We haven’t found a legendary\n",
        "Pokémon, either, though..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0890_SD27R0101_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s Lake Valor?\r",
        "There’s nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake is ordinary, as usual.\r",
        "There’s no legendary Pokémon,\n",
        "either..."
      ]
    },
